title: 밤_1_헬스하기_양나현_영문
---
(I arrived at the gym, did some warm-ups, and sat on a stationary bike for some cardio.)
(As I was catching my breath and wiping off the sweat, someone tapped me on the shoulder.)
(I turned around.)
<<show hyun_idle_ver2>>
<<play hyun_sound>>
NaHyun: Hey.
{name()}: Oh, hey!
{name()}: I didn't know you worked out at this gym too.
NaHyun: I do.
NaHyun: I have to work out at least three times a week to keep my figure in shape.
<<choice 밤_1_헬스하기_긍1_영문 "Same here. I'm practically here every day." 밤_1_헬스하기_부1_영문 "I signed up, but I barely show up once or twice a month.">>
NaHyun: How about you?
===

title: 밤_1_헬스하기_긍1_영문
---
<<like 양나현>>
<<change lvHyun +3>>
<<show hyun_neg_ver2>>
NaHyun: Really? You're lying.
NaHyun: This is the first time I've ever run into you at the gym, though...
<<play 양나현_흠>>
<<show hyun_smile_ver2>>
(She looks somewhat suspicious.)
<<jump 밤_1_헬스하기_양나현_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 밤_1_헬스하기_부1_영문
---
<<like 양나현>>
<<change lvHyun +5>>
<<show hyun_smile_ver2>>
NaHyun: I knew it. No wonder I never saw you here.
<<play 양나현_웃음>>
(NaHyun lets out a laugh.)
<<if get("lvHyun") >= 10>>
    <<jump 밤_1_헬스하기_호감도_영문>>
<<else>>
    <<jump 밤_1_헬스하기_양나현_분기1_영문>>
<<endif>>
===

title: 밤_1_헬스하기_호감도_영문
---
NaHyun: Well, now that you have a gym buddy, you'd better work hard.
<<show hyun_blush_ver2>>
NaHyun: I've always liked people who take their fitness seriously.
<<jump 밤_1_헬스하기_양나현_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 밤_1_헬스하기_양나현_분기1_영문
---
<<show hyun_idle_ver2>>
<<if get("str") >= 3>>
    <<jump 밤_1_헬스하기_양나현_근력_영문>>
<<else>>
    <<end>>
<<endif>>
===

title: 밤_1_헬스하기_양나현_근력_영문
---
NaHyun: {name()}. 
<<show hyun_smile_ver2>>
NaHyun: By any chance... do you know how to use this machine?
(NaHyun places her hand on the strength training equipment next to her.)
(It doesn't require massive strength, but you need proper form to see any results.)
<<choice 밤_1_헬스하기_긍2_영문 "Of course. Have a seat." 밤_1_헬스하기_부2_영문 "I'm not really sure about this one...">>
NaHyun: Can you help me out?
===

title: 밤_1_헬스하기_긍2_영문
---
<<change lvHyun +5>>
<<like 양나현>>
<<show hyun_idle_ver2>>
NaHyun: Like this?
{name()}: Yeah. Grab here and pull your arms back like this.
(NaHyun exerts force and pulls the machine's handles.)
<<play 공통_덜그럭>>
(Her form looks pretty good.)
{name()}: Not bad! It’d be even better if you drop your shoulders just a bit more.
{name()}: Feel the squeeze in your back as you pull.
<<show hyun_blush_ver2>>
NaHyun: How is it now?
(NaHyun’s back muscles are clearly visible.)
(Her back is well-toned. It seems she wasn't kidding about working out frequently.)
{name()}: Perfect. Give me ten reps just like that.
(I helped her out while checking her posture.)
<<show hyun_smile_ver2>>
NaHyun: Thanks. 
NaHyun: Let's work out together again if we run into each other next time.
<<end>>
===

title: 밤_1_헬스하기_부2_영문
---
<<change lvHyun -5>>
<<dislike 양나현>>
<<show hyun_idle_ver2>>
NaHyun: Ah... I see.
NaHyun: Well, nothing I can do then... I'll just have to look up a tutorial video.
NaHyun: Have a good workout.
<<play 공통_발소리>>
(NaHyun waves goodbye and walks over to the machines on the opposite side.)
<<end>>
===